# Environment variables for the /api/pptv proxy (all OPTIONAL).
# Copy to .env for local dev, or set them in Vercel → Settings → Environment
# Variables. NEVER commit real values — .env is git-ignored.

# Upstream host (default: https://www-api.pptvhd36.com)
# PPTV_HOST=

# Upstream election base path (default: the 2026 BKK election path, Thai)
# PPTV_BASE_PATH=

# Credential, ONLY if the upstream ever requires one. When set, it is sent as
# the `x-api-key` header from the server — it is never exposed to the browser.
# PPTV_API_KEY=
